# A sketch of a theme over the resolution's fixture: the roots of three targets, the buttons'
# corner, the danger button's own corner, Go's surface on the danger button, the ink of every
# button that commits, the pane's surface; a treatment at the root and one at the buttons.
root               rest      shape-corner
root               rest      color-surface
button             rest      shape-corner
danger-button      rest      shape-corner
danger-button_go   rest      color-surface
button_committing  rest      color-ink
floating-pane      rest      color-surface
root               disabled  effect-opacity
button             disabled  color-surface
